1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,395
A sharp rally, then a quiet pause.

2
00:00:02,764 --> 00:00:04,007
Here's what it might mean.

3
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:11,058
A bull flag starts with a sharp rally, the pole, then a quiet drift lower on light volume, the flag.

4
00:00:11,406 --> 00:00:14,814
When price breaks out of the flag, the trend often continues.

5
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:20,862
But flags fail too. Watch out if it drifts too deep, or if volume is heavy on the pullback.

6
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:23,606
A stop below the flag limits the damage.

7
00:00:24,106 --> 00:00:26,671
Practise spotting flags at memestreet.net.

